# Buildroot BR2_EXTERNAL descriptor for the RanA guest tree.
# Defines the "RANA" external name, which yields the make/kconfig variable
# BR2_EXTERNAL_RANA_PATH (referenced by configs/rana_guest_defconfig for the
# kernel fragment path). See guest/README.md.
name: RANA
desc: RanA macOS guest base layer (BTF kernel, virtiofs, vsock, cgroup2)
